        "TileImage": "$($repository 438f667a-6095-4b66-9ac3-589090ec8315).Image",
        "Description": "New intel has surfaced on hidden operatives in Berlin. \r\rA silent plot to overthrow the world&apos;s superpowers has garnered the attention of the ICA. A terrorist organization known only as &apos;Tartarus&apos;. Do not allow them to control the world&apos;s governments from the shadows. The operatives prefer to hide in plain sight. Use any and all means necessary to eliminate your opposition. However, to avoid unwanted attention from this new organization, discretion is advised.\r\rFurther intel forthcoming 47...",
